{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-integration","title":"CI/CD 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/pipeline-and-devops/ci-cd-integration","wordCount":542,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-集成\">CI/CD 集成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI/CD 集成要做的事，是把本地跑得通的构建流程原样搬到服务器上，并在每次代码推送时自动重放：依赖安装 → 代码检查 → 类型检查 → 测试 → 构建 → 部署。构建工具链在其中是主体，而非周边——每一步的可靠性与耗时都直接决定流水线的质量。因此除了「能不能跑」，还要回答三个工程问题：依赖如何缓存以省去重复安装、任务如何并行以缩短总时长、密钥与环境变量如何安全注入。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建流水线在-ci-cd-中的角色\">构建流水线在 CI/CD 中的角色</h2><p>CI/CD（持续集成/持续部署）将开发者本地的构建流程自动化到服务器环境中。每当代码推送到仓库，CI 系统自动触发构建、检查、测试和部署流程。构建工具链在其中承担着核心角色——从代码检查到类型验证，从打包构建到产物部署，每一步都依赖构建工具链的可靠执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    PUSH[代码推送]&#10;    INSTALL[依赖安装]&#10;    LINT[代码检查&lt;br/&gt;ESLint + Stylelint]&#10;    TYPE[类型检查&lt;br/&gt;tsc --noEmit]&#10;    TEST[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;Vitest]&#10;    BUILD[构建&lt;br/&gt;Rsbuild/Vite]&#10;    E2E[E2E 测试&lt;br/&gt;Playwright]&#10;    DEPLOY[部署&lt;br/&gt;CDN/服务器]&#10;&#10;    PUSH --&gt; INSTALL --&gt; LINT --&gt; TYPE --&gt; TEST --&gt; BUILD --&gt; E2E --&gt; DEPLOY\">flowchart LR\n    PUSH[代码推送]\n    INSTALL[依赖安装]\n    LINT[代码检查&lt;br/&gt;ESLint + Stylelint]\n    TYPE[类型检查&lt;br/&gt;tsc --noEmit]\n    TEST[单元测试&lt;br/&gt;Vitest]\n    BUILD[构建&lt;br/&gt;Rsbuild/Vite]\n    E2E[E2E 测试&lt;br/&gt;Playwright]\n    DEPLOY[部署&lt;br/&gt;CDN/服务器]\n\n    PUSH --&gt; INSTALL --&gt; LINT --&gt; TYPE --&gt; TEST --&gt; BUILD --&gt; E2E --&gt; DEPLOY</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-配置\">GitHub Actions 配置</h2><h3 id=\"基础-ci-流水线\">基础 CI 流水线</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/ci.yml&#10;name: CI&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main, develop]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;concurrency:&#10;  group: ci-${{ github.ref }}&#10;  cancel-in-progress: true&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  ci:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        node-version: [20, 22]&#10;&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup pnpm&#10;        uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          version: 9&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Node.js ${{ matrix.node-version }}&#10;        uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - name: Install dependencies&#10;        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Lint&#10;        run: pnpm lint&#10;&#10;      - name: Type check&#10;        run: pnpm typecheck&#10;&#10;      - name: Test&#10;        run: pnpm test&#10;&#10;      - name: Build&#10;        run: pnpm build&#10;&#10;      - name: Upload build artifacts&#10;        if: github.ref == &#39;refs/heads/main&#39;&#10;        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          name: dist-${{ matrix.node-version }}&#10;          path: dist/&#10;          retention-days: 7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark: